 "summary": "No existing declaration covers these results: TauCeti has no additivity or complement lemma for `IsLowerDirichletDensityBound`/`IsUpperDirichletDensityBound` (only `.mono`, `.mono_set` in `DirichletDensityBounds.lean` and `DirichletDensity/Basic.lean`), Mathlib's `DirichletDensity.lean` has no partition or sum-to-one lemma, and no `Nat.card (ConjClasses G) = Nat.card G` lemma exists in Mathlib. The PR reuses the located API where it exists (`sum_primeIdealZetaSum_frobeniusPrimeSet`, `hasDirichletDensity_biUnion_finset`, `HasDirichletDensity.unique`, `hasDirichletDensity_of_upperBound_of_lowerBound`, `eventually_all_finset`, `ConjClasses.mkEquiv`).",
